cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AI-Noether, please cite the paper below."
title: "AI-Noether"
abstract: >-
  An algebraic-geometry-based abductive inference system that, given an
  incomplete axiom system expressible as polynomials and a hypothesis the
  axioms cannot derive, generates candidate axioms that, when added to the
  theory, provably derive the (possibly noisy) hypothesis.
